# Equinox does not counter a spell that destroys only an opponent's land (CR 608.2): Bot2 aims Cleansing Wildfire at its own
# Mountain. Equinox's speculation played it out on a hidden copy - a search, a shuffle and a draw from Bot2's library - and
# none of it reached the game: for real, Bot2 declines the search, nothing is shuffled, and Bot2 draws the Lightning Bolt
# that was on top of its library all along.

